<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-26T20:40:34.465Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:40:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Two Philippine Coast Guard bomb experts were wounded in an accidental explosion at their Zamboanga City barracks, and two other Coast Guard members were injured in a separate blast in the same city. A fatal midair collision of two SF-260 aircraft killed four Philippine Air Force pilots. Chinese aircraft carrier and militia vessels transited near Mindanao and Zamboanga coasts, prompting AFP monitoring and tracking of the carrier strike group near Zamboanga. The Philippines, United States and Japan completed their 22nd multilateral maritime cooperative activity in the West Philippine Sea, and the PCG drove a foreign fishing vessel out of Pag-asa waters. There were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNQTJuYkJMaFFSSDlFX2FpVlB1WXFJUGxUZGR1NE9XSG4tMzBQU3pjRGhlX2hJUng1M0hCbC1mZ1pTZ3FxcnpIT0tQdjRwMnFzeC1HaEx6YWZrWjIyNlp5WEluUkMwdDlndXk0QmdROEFsQVhINDZIV0k2THlmSl8xNzE2dW9XbHMzUHVBZmJWaXlDeVJrLWgzSw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5MeFR4MThsczQ3TEkxMzJoSE9WMThuVFB3R2lNVUZsTjdRV2kzTXRLaTdtRzJaQm5sRTh2TjJETkgyUGY5QUdxUXp2X2FxNHF4amxTX1d0bHNKOWpHbEhheDlR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQX1U5ZDJqS0FSV0w2SEYyVU5sTmNIOERvYXhIUnRkMWZRVWdZdnlDdnJCSE1NZnFNYnpfd25leDBBMlYtX3NKNDV6c0tMVFF1SzRCS0Ntdlk5Zlo0UzlqU2FwZkxlaE1rclFGZ3BQT1JrV0hxVGhLblNocDJpaU1iWXViNm5RUVFlS0dHVXlVZWh4bzcwbVU4QW5ESDFwLWI5dWZJTkotcmZPbTUtV0tYM2RORDFfb2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;USNI News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQZlVFaEE4TWhtNjZTcTVrVVJiT3c1aFBjbTlrTzdkY3pXSnpfWWdjYjU2dDVrLTJQc004RFdCZGxHN0NRd1E2eFNkV29nUTh6V